BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:September ASPCA Rescue Effect Adoption Promotion
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260905T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260918T170000
DTSTAMP:20260904T122004Z
UID:gz-september-aspca-rescue-effect-adoption-promotion-1915445@southbaldw
 inchamber.com
DESCRIPTION:Description\n🐾 Adopt One\, Help Many. That’s The Rescue E
 ffect.\n\nThe Haven is proud to participate in the ASPCA’s Rescue Effect
 \, a nationwide campaign helping more shelter pets find loving homes.\n\nT
 hanks to a $10\,000 grant from the ASPCA\, adoption fees will be completel
 y waived for eligible dogs and cats ages 6 months and older at The Haven d
 uring our September Rescue Effect promotional period: September 5–19\, 2
 026\nRegular adoption fees of $150 for adult cats and $200 for adult dogs 
 will be waived during the promotion.\n\n❤️ What stays the same?\nOur a
 doption application and approval process. Removing the adoption fee remove
 s one financial barrier—not our commitment to finding the right match be
 tween pets and families.\n\nEvery adoption changes the life of the pet goi
 ng home while also creating space\, time and resources to help the next ho
 meless animal who needs us. That’s the ripple behind The Rescue Effect.
 \n\nOur goal is to place 51 adult cats and dogs into loving homes during t
 he August–October campaign\, and your adoption can help us get there!\n
 \n📅 September 5–19\, 2026\n🐶🐱 Eligible dogs and cats: 6 months 
 and older\n💙 Adoption fees: WAIVED\n📍 The Haven for Animals\n\nView 
 our available pets and learn more about The Rescue Effect here: https://ww
 w.havenforanimals.org/aspca-rescue-effect/\n\nWe encourage prospective ado
 pters to view available pets and complete the adoption application before 
 visiting The Haven.\n\nAdopt One. Help Many. That’s The Rescue Effect.\n
 #TheRescueEffect #HavenForAnimals #AdoptDontShop #PetAdoption\n\n---\n🌐
  View original event: https://businesshub.southbaldwinchamber.com/calendar
 /Details/september-aspca-rescue-effect-adoption-promotion-1915445
LOCATION:The Haven\, 559 S Section Street\, Fairhope\,\, AL\, 36532\, Unit
 ed States
END:VEVENT
