UID:gz-2026-walton-m-vines-free-enterprise-person-of-the-year-summit-16825
 53@southbaldwinchamber.com
DESCRIPTION:Description\nLocation: Foley Civic Center\nCatering:\nHalf She
 ll Oyster House\nSince 1976\, the South Baldwin Chamber of Commerce has be
 en celebrating the spirit of the Free Enterprise system by awarding the\nW
 alton M. Vines Free Enterprise Person of the Year\n. This award is present
 ed by\nRiviera Utilities\nand is one of South Baldwin's most coveted award
 s.\nTo be nominated\, a person must still be active in business affairs\, 
 have a good moral reputation\, be active in civic and community affairs\, 
 and be committed to helping others grow. The winner is honored during the 
 Free Enterprise Person of the Year Luncheon at the Foley Civic Center\, wh
 ich is attended by more than one hundred of the area's top business leader
 s and community members.\nThe Luncheon features a full catered meal and sp
 eeches from the previous year's winner along with the newly honored Person
  of the Year. You are invited to join us for this prestigious event!\nView
  Event Webpage\n\n---\n🌐 View original event: https://businesshub.south
 baldwinchamber.com/calendar/Details/2026-walton-m-vines-free-enterprise-pe
