BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2026 Tails of Hope Gala: The Art of Rescue Benefiting The Haven fo
 r Animals
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261001T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261001T213000
DTSTAMP:20260904T122004Z
UID:gz-2026-tails-of-hope-gala-the-art-of-rescue-benefiting-the-haven-for-
 animals-1915564@southbaldwinchamber.com
DESCRIPTION:Description\nStep into an evening where compassion meets creat
 ivity at the 2026 Tails of Hope Gala: The Art of Rescue.\nJoin us on Thurs
 day\, October 1 at 6:00 p.m. at the Daphne Civic Center for an elegant\, a
 rt gallery–inspired experience—where every rescued animal is a masterp
 iece and every story is worth celebrating.\nThis signature event brings to
 gether animal lovers\, community leaders\, and supporters for a night of c
 onnection and impact. Through curated displays of adoptable pets\, powerfu
 l rescue stories\, and meaningful giving opportunities\, you’ll experien
 ce The Haven’s mission in a way that stays with you long after the eveni
 ng ends.\nSince 2000\, The Haven has been a leader in the no-kill movement
  in Baldwin County. In 2025 alone\, The Haven helped 804 animals\, celebra
 ted 412 adoptions\, provided over $63\,000 in medical care\, administered 
 nearly 1\,900 vaccines\, and performed 473 spay and neuter surgeries—all
  made possible by the support of this community.\n✨ Event Details:\n📅
  Thursday\, October 1\, 2026\n⏰ 6:00 PM – 9:30 PM\n📍 Daphne Civic C
 enter\nEvery ticket\, sponsorship\, and donation helps create a second cha
 nce for animals in need.\n🎟️ Learn more\, purchase tickets\, or becom
 e a sponsor: https://bit.ly/TailsofHope2026 Join us for an unforgettable n
 ight where compassion becomes action—and every life we touch is a work o
 f art.\n#TailsOfHope #TheArtOfRescue #AdoptFromTheHaven #SavingLives\n\n--
 -\n🌐 View original event: https://businesshub.southbaldwinchamber.com/c
 alendar/Details/2026-tails-of-hope-gala-the-art-of-rescue-benefiting-the-h
 aven-for-animals-1915564
LOCATION:Daphne Civic Center\, 2603 US Hwy 98\, Daphne\,\, AL\, 36526\, Un
 ited States
END:VEVENT
