BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:October ASPCA Rescue Effect Adoption Promotion at The Haven
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261003T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261003T010000
DTSTAMP:20260904T122004Z
UID:gz-october-aspca-rescue-effect-adoption-promotion-at-the-haven-1915522
 @southbaldwinchamber.com
DESCRIPTION:Description\n🐾 Adopt One\, Help Many. That’s The Rescue E
 ffect.\nThe Haven is proud to participate in the ASPCA’s Rescue Effect\,
  a nationwide campaign helping more shelter pets find loving homes.\nThank
 s to a $10\,000 grant from the ASPCA\, adoption fees will be completely wa
 ived for eligible dogs and cats ages 6 months and older at The Haven durin
 g our October Rescue Effect promotional period: October 3–17\, 2026\nReg
 ular adoption fees of $150 for adult cats and $200 for adult dogs will be 
 waived during the promotion.\n❤️ What stays the same?\nOur adoption ap
 plication and approval process. Removing the adoption fee removes one fina
 ncial barrier—not our commitment to finding the right match between pets
  and families.\nEvery adoption changes the life of the pet going home whil
 e also creating space\, time and resources to help the next homeless anima
 l who needs us. That’s the ripple behind The Rescue Effect.\nOur goal is
  to place 51 adult cats and dogs into loving homes during the August–Oct
 ober campaign\, and your adoption can help us get there!\n📅 October 3
 –17\, 2026\n🐶🐱 Eligible dogs and cats: 6 months and older\n💙 Ad
 option fees: WAIVED\n📍 The Haven for Animals\nView our available pets a
 nd learn more about The Rescue Effect here: https://www.havenforanimals.or
 g/aspca-rescue-effect/\nWe encourage prospective adopters to view availabl
 e pets and complete the adoption application before visiting The Haven.\nA
 dopt One. Help Many. That’s The Rescue Effect.\n#TheRescueEffect #HavenF
 orAnimals #AdoptDontShop #PetAdoption\n\n---\n🌐 View original event: ht
 tps://businesshub.southbaldwinchamber.com/calendar/Details/october-aspca-r
 escue-effect-adoption-promotion-at-the-haven-1915522
LOCATION:The Haven for Animals\, 559 S Section Street\, Fairhope\,\, AL\, 
 36532\, United States
END:VEVENT
