 the Foley Lions Club. It’s a\nnon-competitive ride that begins at the Fo
 ley Sports Complex:\nno racing\, just a great day in beautiful Baldwin Cou
 nty with friends\, neighbors\, and fellow supporters. E-bikes are welcome!
 \nYour entry fee includes a commemorative T-shirt. Contact us for sponsors
 hip opportunities!\nChoose from two routes: a 40-mile ride or a 23-mile pa
 rtial route. Convenient rest stations will be provided along both routes. 
 On-site check-in begins at 7:30 AM. Plenty of parking is available at the 
 sports complex.\nWe appreciate your support of the\nFoley Lions Club\nand 
 look forward to seeing you there!\nPlease note that routes shown on the re
 gistration site may change slightly between now and November 14.\nRegister
